# Pets on errands can still go: the edge's shelves count everyone who may go ("n working" are on
# errands), and sending takes resting pets first, then pets off their errands. The errands tab's
# "up to" line under the join switches keeps rarer new pets resting.
from rich
view full
stickers off                  # new pets here can fill a book page: no sticker popups over the shots
pets 6
herd common normal 300
herd rare normal 60
unlock page:beyond
unlock location:orchard
unlock feature:edge
find basket                   # errands open (the basket's pet starts on the coin hunt)
wait popup
click "lovely"
job coin_hunt 400
edge
wait 1
expect text "60 working"
expect fits
shot edge_working
click "rare"
click "10"
wait 1
expect fits
shot edge_sent
tab errands
wait 1
expect text "up to"
expect fits
shot errands_up_to
